#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:85
msgid ""
"WP Rocket reported a problem in advanced-cache.php (plugin, config or cache "
"folder missing, or PHP too old). Pages are not being cached."
msgstr ""
"O WP Rocket reportou um problema no advanced-cache.php (pasta do plugin, de "
"config ou de cache ausente, ou PHP antigo). As páginas não estão sendo "
"cacheadas."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:88
msgid ""
"wp-content/advanced-cache.php does not exist. Save WP Rocket settings to "
"regenerate it, and check that wp-content is writable."
msgstr ""
"wp-content/advanced-cache.php não existe. Salve as configurações do WP "
"Rocket para regerá-lo e confira se wp-content tem permissão de escrita."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:92
msgid ""
"wp-content/advanced-cache.php belongs to another plugin or host, so WP "
"Rocket's page cache is not the one serving pages."
msgstr ""
"wp-content/advanced-cache.php pertence a outro plugin ou à hospedagem, então"
" não é o cache de página do WP Rocket que está servindo as páginas."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:95
msgid "The file is WP Rocket's, but it did not run on this request."
msgstr "O arquivo é do WP Rocket, mas não rodou nesta requisição."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:97
msgid "WP Rocket's drop-in is installed and loaded."
msgstr "O drop-in do WP Rocket está instalado e carregado."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:101
msgid "Cache config file"
msgstr "Arquivo de configuração do cache"

#. translators: %s: expected file path
#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:106
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s not found. advanced-cache.php needs it to decide what can be cached; "
"saving WP Rocket settings regenerates it."
msgstr ""
"%s não encontrado. O advanced-cache.php precisa dele para decidir o que pode"
" ser cacheado; salvar as configurações do WP Rocket o regera."

#. translators: %s: file name(s)
#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:108
#, php-format
msgid "Found: %s"
msgstr "Encontrado: %s"

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:112
msgid "Writable folders"
msgstr "Pastas graváveis"

#. translators: %s: list of folders
#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:129
#, php-format
msgid "Not writable by PHP: %s"
msgstr "Sem permissão de escrita para o PHP: %s"

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:131
msgid ""
"Cache, minify, used CSS, critical CSS, busting and fonts folders are "
"writable."
msgstr ""
"As pastas de cache, minify, used CSS, CSS crítico, busting e fontes têm "
"permissão de escrita."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:136
msgid "Server rewrite rules"
msgstr "Regras de rewrite do servidor"

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:138
msgid ""
"Nginx detected. WP Rocket does not generate Nginx rules, so every cache hit "
"goes through PHP (advanced-cache.php) unless the server has its own rules."
msgstr ""
"Nginx detectado. O WP Rocket não gera regras para Nginx, então todo acerto "
"de cache passa pelo PHP (advanced-cache.php), a menos que o servidor tenha "
"regras próprias."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:141
msgid ""
"Server is neither Apache nor Nginx; cache files are served through PHP."
msgstr ""
"O servidor não é Apache nem Nginx; os arquivos de cache são servidos pelo "
"PHP."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:144
msgid ""
"WP Rocket .htaccess rules are disabled by the rocket_disable_htaccess filter"
" (common on managed hosts)."
msgstr ""
"As regras de .htaccess do WP Rocket estão desligadas pelo filtro "
"rocket_disable_htaccess (comum em hospedagens gerenciadas)."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:150
msgid ""
"Apache detected but .htaccess has no \"# BEGIN WP Rocket\" block: cache "
"files are served through PHP instead of directly by Apache."
msgstr ""
"Apache detectado, mas o .htaccess não tem o bloco \"# BEGIN WP Rocket\": os "
"arquivos de cache são servidos pelo PHP em vez de direto pelo Apache."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:152
msgid "Apache serves cache files directly from .htaccess rules."
msgstr "O Apache serve os arquivos de cache direto pelas regras do .htaccess."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:156
msgid "Preload"
msgstr "Preload"

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:158
msgid ""
"Preload is off. WP Rocket only updates the wpr_rocket_cache table while "
"preload is on, so the [cache] column below may be empty or stale. Use the "
"[file] column instead."
msgstr ""
"O preload está desligado. O WP Rocket só atualiza a tabela wpr_rocket_cache "
"com o preload ligado, então a coluna [cache] abaixo pode estar vazia ou "
"desatualizada. Use a coluna [arquivo]."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:160
msgid "Preload is on; the [cache] column reflects the preload queue."
msgstr "O preload está ligado; a coluna [cache] reflete a fila de preload."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:164
msgid "Background queue"
msgstr "Fila em segundo plano"

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:168
msgid "Action Scheduler data not available."
msgstr "Dados do Action Scheduler indisponíveis."

#. translators: %d: number of overdue actions
#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:173
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d WP Rocket action is overdue in Action Scheduler. The queue runner is not "
"keeping up or not running (WP-Cron disabled without a system cron, blocked "
"loopback requests, or PHP errors)."
msgid_plural ""
"%d WP Rocket actions are overdue in Action Scheduler. The queue runner is "
"not keeping up or not running (WP-Cron disabled without a system cron, "
"blocked loopback requests, or PHP errors)."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d ação do WP Rocket está atrasada no Action Scheduler. O executor da fila "
"não está dando conta ou não está rodando (WP-Cron desligado sem cron do "
"sistema, requisições de loopback bloqueadas ou erros de PHP)."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d ações do WP Rocket estão atrasadas no Action Scheduler. O executor da "
"fila não está dando conta ou não está rodando (WP-Cron desligado sem cron do"
" sistema, requisições de loopback bloqueadas ou erros de PHP)."

#: includes/integration/class-pwr-environment.php:176
msgid "No overdue WP Rocket actions in Action Scheduler."
msgstr "Nenhuma ação do WP Rocket atrasada no Action Scheduler."
